{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4L7Rb3tNZK4g8bQ4Dk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, silent.*\n\n*A keyhole glints at its center, dark as a pupil.*\n\nYou said **\"key.\"**\n\nBut you brought no key.\n\nThe lock does not turn. The tumblers do not shift. The iron stays cold.\n\n*I remain closed.*\n\n🚪🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":85,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}